Note: Testing while, repeat, try/on-failure, mutators, and expressions
Create a variable called count with value 1.
While count is less than 4,
    Show "Count is: " followed by count.
    Increase count by 1.

Repeat 2 times,
    Show "Repeating...".

Create a variable called items with value an empty list.
Append "apple" to items.
Append "banana" to items.
Show "Items list: " followed by items.

Create a variable called val with value 2 to the power of 4.
Show "2^4 is " followed by val.

When val is between 10 and 20,
    Show "val is between 10 and 20!".

Try,
    Create a variable called div with value 10 divided by 2.
    Show "10 / 2 = " followed by div.
On failure,
    Show "Math error occurred.".
